 linuxmuster-linbo7 - linuxmuster-linbo7
Changes:
 linuxmuster-linbo7 (7.4.18) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * feat(linbo-torrent): enable LPD and a 5 minute tracker interval by
     default (#152, d08c577).
   * feat(linbo-remote): write one logfile per run - the log is named
     <host>_linbo-remote_<YYYYmmddHHMMSS>.log, so a new run no longer
     truncates the previous one (#179, 5b325b2).
   * feat(linbo-remote): append a JSON record per finished run to
     linbo-remote_runs.jsonl in the LINBO log directory (#179, 99a3b68).
   * fix(linbo-remote): record 128+signal as rc of an aborted run
     (#179, 6f13ee0).
   * feat(linbo-remote): prune old per-run logs, rotate the run record
     (#179, dd53957).
   * fix(init.sh): do not hang in udhcpc on an interface that is down (#187, 84a0a91).
   * fix(linbo_mountcache): find the cache partition without by-id links (#189, 3757567).
